ung fields. Laboratory results were within normal limits, with no significant abnormalities noted. \n\nMr. Merritt's current medications include spironolactone 25 mg, which is effective in managing his heart failure/cardiomyopathy. There have been no recent changes to his medication regimen, and he has been compliant with his treatment plan. \n\nOverall, Mr. Merritt's condition remains stable, and he continues to receive appropriate care to manage his heart failure and cardiomyopathy. He is encouraged to maintain a healthy lifestyle, including regular follow-ups and monitoring of his cardiac function. \n\nAdditionally, Mr."
